---
// SolarChart.astro
---

<figure class="margin-0 p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-md border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--surface)] transition-colors">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 760 316" role="img" aria-labelledby="chart-t chart-d" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="block w-full h-auto overflow-visible">
    <title id="chart-t">Un giorno di produzione, consumi e ricarica dell'auto</title>
    <desc id="chart-d">La produzione fotovoltaica prevista sale fino a circa 5 kW a metà giornata. Il consumo della casa resta sotto 1 kW di giorno e sale a 2 kW la sera. Il solver assegna la ricarica dell'auto da 3,7 kW dalle 11 alle 15, quando il sole produce più di quanto la casa consuma.</desc>
    
    <!-- Griglia e Valori Asse Y -->
    <line class="stroke-[var(--rule)] stroke-1" x1="48" x2="740" y1="240.0" y2="240.0"/>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="40" y="244.0" text-anchor="end">0</text>
    
    <line class="stroke-[var(--rule)] stroke-1" x1="48" x2="740" y1="166.7" y2="166.7"/>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="40" y="170.7" text-anchor="end">2</text>
    
    <line class="stroke-[var(--rule)] stroke-1" x1="48" x2="740" y1="93.3" y2="93.3"/>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="40" y="97.3" text-anchor="end">4</text>
    
    <line class="stroke-[var(--rule)] stroke-1" x1="48" x2="740" y1="20.0" y2="20.0"/>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="40" y="24.0" text-anchor="end">6</text>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="40" y="12" text-anchor="end">kW</text>

    <!-- Asse X Orario -->
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="48.0" y="306" text-anchor="middle">00</text>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="221.0" y="306" text-anchor="middle">06</text>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="394.0" y="306" text-anchor="middle">12</text>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="567.0" y="306" text-anchor="middle">18</text>
    <text class="fill-[var(--muted)] font-medium text-[13px] [font-family:var(--f-display)]" x="740.0" y="306" text-anchor="middle">24</text>
    
    <!-- Marker Inizio e Fine Ricarica -->
    <line class="stroke-[var(--plan)] stroke-1 opacity-60 [stroke-dasharray:3_4]" x1="365.2" x2="365.2" y1="20" y2="282"/>
    <line class="stroke-[var(--plan)] stroke-1 opacity-60 [stroke-dasharray:3_4]" x1="480.5" x2="480.5" y1="20" y2="282"/>
    
    <!-- Area Fotovoltaico -->
    <path class="fill-[var(--sun)] fill-opacity-25 fadein" d="M221.0,240.0 L228.2,237.5 L235.4,232.9 L242.6,226.9 L249.8,220.0 L257.0,212.2 L264.2,203.8 L271.5,194.9 L278.7,185.5 L285.9,175.9 L293.1,166.0 L300.3,156.1 L307.5,146.1 L314.7,136.3 L321.9,126.6 L329.1,117.2 L336.3,108.2 L343.5,99.6 L350.8,91.4 L358.0,83.9 L365.2,76.9 L372.4,70.7 L379.6,65.2 L386.8,60.4 L394.0,56.5 L401.2,53.4 L408.4,51.1 L415.6,49.8 L422.8,49.3 L430.0,49.8 L437.2,51.1 L444.5,53.4 L451.7,56.5 L458.9,60.4 L466.1,65.2 L473.3,70.7 L480.5,77.0 L487.7,84.1 L494.9,92.3 L502.1,101.8 L509.3,112.6 L516.5,123.9 L523.8,134.4 L531.0,143.2 L538.2,150.9 L545.4,158.5 L552.6,167.0 L559.8,176.2 L567.0,185.6 L574.2,194.9 L581.4,203.8 L588.6,212.2 L595.8,220.0 L603.0,226.9 L610.2,232.9 L617.5,237.5 L624.7,240.0 L624.7,240.0 L221.0,240.0 Z"/>
    
